content.text:
请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-19-photo-album-002

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
帮我弄个图为主的相册卡，数字会变，点一下能进入清理操作，提醒我快不行了

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "帮我弄个图为主的相册卡，数字会变，点一下能进入清理操作，提醒我快不行了",
  "size": "2x4",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings",
        "abilityName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings.MainAbility",
        "uri": "storage_settings"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "album": {
      "photoCountText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "相册照片总数的展示文本",
        "sampleValue": "12,486张照片"
      },
      "usedText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "相册或设备存储占用比例的展示文本",
        "sampleValue": "92%"
      },
      "reclaimableText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "可通过相册清理释放的空间展示文本",
        "sampleValue": "可清理 6.8GB"
      },
      "warningText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "相册空间紧张时的短警告提示",
        "sampleValue": "空间快不行了"
      },
      "actionText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "进入清理操作的短动作文本",
        "sampleValue": "去清理"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_clear.png",
      "description": "清除图标，适合相册清理、释放空间和存储整理入口，作为图像主导卡片的主视觉素材。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
